{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-04-21 16:15:00', 'title': "CPC LAUNCHES BIOPHARMA'S LARGEST ASEPTIC CONNECTOR", 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , APRIL 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CPC (COLDER PRODUCTS COMPANY), PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF CONNECTION TECHNOLOGIES USED IN BIOPHARMACEUTICAL PROCESSING, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS ASEPTIQUIK®\xa0W SERIES, THE INDUSTRY'S LARGEST GENDERLESS ASEPTIC CONNECTORS."}